     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"EN-AU\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hi all,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Can anyone clarify the units that are used when specifying “cellsize” in the “<a href=\"http://grid.info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://grid.info&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246304994000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2dHTjdMZ2jxGmcYQhYWyqW\">grid.info</a>” function?  E.g.: <a href=\"http://grid.info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://grid.info&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246304994000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2dHTjdMZ2jxGmcYQhYWyqW\">grid.info</a>(lats,cellsize,r=6378137)<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The information given in the help menu is:<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">cellsize: is a single value (assuming square cells) or a two value<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">          vector (rectangular cells) representing the height (latitude)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">          and width (longitude) of the cells<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">does that mean that when you add in the value for cellsize it is assumed to be in degrees?  I am working with a grid with 0.01 degree cells, and trying to calculate the area.<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Many thanks,<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">April<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#4f81bd\">Dr April Reside<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Centaur&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Postdoctoral Research Fellow<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Centaur&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Centaur&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Centre for Tropical Biodiversity and Climate Change<br>\r\nSchool of Marine and Tropical Biology<br>\r\nATSIP, James Cook University, Townsville, QLD, Australia 4811| Ph: <a href=\"tel:+61%207%204781%205351\" value=\"+61747815351\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+61 7 4781 5351</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Centaur&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:#548dd4\"><a href=\"https://research.jcu.edu.au/research/ctbcc/our-people/staff-profile-pages/reside-april-postdoctoral-research-fellow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://research.jcu.edu.au/research/ctbcc/our-people/staff-profile-pages/reside-april-postdoctoral-research-fellow&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246304994000&amp;usg=AOvVaw17G0hDy8xK0SU031VChM2_\">https://research.jcu.edu.au/research/ctbcc/our-people/staff-profile-pages/reside-april-postdoctoral-research-fellow</a><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Centaur&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">Google scholar:<span style=\"color:#548dd4\"> <a href=\"http://scholar.google.com/citations?user=z2jRx3QAAAAJ&amp;hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://scholar.google.com/citations?user%3Dz2jRx3QAAAAJ%26hl%3Den&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246304994000&amp;usg=AOvVaw00zCMZkqdTrz27yYZc-1cH\">http://scholar.google.com/citations?user=z2jRx3QAAAAJ&amp;hl=en</a><u></u><u></u></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Centaur&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">skype: april.reside</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Batang&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
    ]
