     "<div dir=\"ltr\">correct ... cellsize is in &quot;degrees&quot; latitude and longitude... simply put cellsize=0.01 for your example.<div><br></div><div>Jeremy</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div></div>"
